    "PR description: 'Currently, to decide whether mempool fee inflow rose enough to be worth a new template, waitNext locks cs_main and assembles a full block template every tick just to sum its fees and compare.'",
    "PR description: 'The fuzz test already caught a bug in the miner where it skips legitimate transactions due to an incorrect block chunk size limit check #35580.'"
